zh/ayah/70-4.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Al-Ma&#x27;aarij 70:4 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Melekler ve Ruh (Cebrâîl) ona süresi elli bin yıl olan bir günde yükselir.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/70.html\">Sûre Al-Ma&#x27;aarij</a> › Âyet 4</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Al-Ma&#x27;aarij 70:4</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿تَعْرُجُ الْمَلَائِكَةُ وَالرُّوحُ إِلَيْهِ فِي يَوْمٍ كَانَ مِقْدَارُهُ خَمْسِينَ أَلْفَ سَنَةٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Melekler ve Ruh (Cebrâîl) ona süresi elli bin yıl olan bir günde yükselir.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><h3>Başkalarından naklettikleri</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">أبو عبد الله</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «هذا منقطع يوجب أنه فوق العرش فوق الأشياء كلها منزه عن الدخول في خلقه لا يخفى عليه منهم خافية؛ لأنه أبان في هذه الآيات أنه أراد أنه بنفسه فوق عباده؛»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 5/68</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><h3>Başkalarından naklettikleri</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">غير مسمى في المقطع</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «والعروج هو الصعود»<cite>«اجتماع الجيوش الإسلامية» 2/144</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s70a4\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/tr/ayah/70-8.html\">Sonraki âyet (70:8)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/70-8.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Al-Ma&#x27;aarij 70:8 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"O gün, gökyüzü erimiş yağ/maden (tortusu) gibi olur.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/70-8.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Al-Ma&#x27;aarij 70:8 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"O gün, gökyüzü erimiş yağ/maden (tortusu) gibi olur.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/70.html\">Sûre Al-Ma&#x27;aarij</a> › Âyet 8</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Al-Ma&#x27;aarij 70:8</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿يَوْمَ تَكُونُ السَّمَاءُ كَالْمُهْلِ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">O gün, gökyüzü erimiş yağ/maden (tortusu) gibi olur.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وأمثال هذه النصوص التي تبين الاستحالة والتغير على السموات والأرض والجبال وأنها تستحيل أنواعا من الاستحالة لتعدد الأوقات.<cite>«الصفدية» 2/225</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s70a8\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/70-4.html\">Önceki âyet (70:4)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/70-9.html\">Sonraki âyet (70:9)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/70-9.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Al-Ma&#x27;aarij 70:9 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dağlar ise saçılmış yünler gibi olacaktır.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/70-9.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Al-Ma&#x27;aarij 70:9 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dağlar ise saçılmış yünler gibi olacaktır.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/70.html\">Sûre Al-Ma&#x27;aarij</a> › Âyet 9</na